  "description": "Amazon S3 provider for Vali-Blob — the unified cloud storage abstraction library for .NET.\n        Implements IBlobProvider over AWS S3 with full support for upload, download, delete,\n        existence checks, presigned URL generation, resumable multipart uploads,\n        Polly-powered retry resilience, and seamless DI registration via AddValiBlob().\n        Targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net6.0, net7.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
